                <pb facs="1118" n="1092" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v10/pg1092"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations
                        of the United States</hi>, 1952-1954. Iran: Volume X. Please be aware that
                    printed volumes have not been revised.</p>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 1087 (date
                            of correction: April 29, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>Typographical error in entry for Middle East Defense has been corrected
                        from 1023-1204 to 1023-1024.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
